/*!
 * \file
 * \brief Defines the compiled Br-76 marginal source-emission laws.
 *
 * LNHB: A. L. Nichols, 2015 evaluation; 2016 tables and April 2017 erratum.
 * Selected EC/beta-plus source emissions.
 *
 * BetaShape 2.4 (06/2024): calculated transition shapes. Conditional masses
 * integrate the selected piecewise-linear densities; full-support
 * references and finite grids remain distinct.
 *
 * The retained fixint=1 run preserves evaluated EC/beta-plus yields. EC
 * creates no primary; source annihilation photons are excluded.
 *
 * Retained forbidden non-unique laws carry Xi-approximation warnings;
 * numerical agreement does not establish experimental shape accuracy.
 *
 * The 3941 keV branch uses bins up to 1 keV to retain positive-tail ticket
 * reachability; other branches use bins up to 0.5 keV.
 *
 * Physical yields remain independent emissions per parent decay. Selected
 * photon and conversion lines use absolute LNHB yields; unsupported Auger
 * energy laws are excluded.
 *
 * Selection and exclusions: validation/radioactivity/data/Br-76/reference/.
 *
 * \author Julien BERT <julien.bert@univ-brest.fr>
 * \author Didier BENOIT <didier.benoit@inserm.fr>
 */

